cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Measuring Organizational Constructs in Large-Scale Text"
abstract: >
  Code repository accompanying the paper "Measuring Organizational Constructs
  in Large-Scale Text" published in Organization Studies. Implements a
  two-stage framework that combines Structural Topic Modeling (STM) and
  BERT-based multi-label classification to measure organizational constructs
  from large-scale employee review data.
